        "body": "Learners pay through your own **Stripe**, **Lemon Squeezy** or **Razorpay** account, so the money goes straight to you. CourseLit takes no cut of your sales on any plan.\n\n- Free, one-time, subscription (monthly or yearly) and instalment plans of 2 to 60 payments\n- Several plans per course, download or community\n- Bundle courses and downloads into a community plan\n\n[How payments work](/payments)"
